name modulus
category Package
revision 47599
shortdesc A non-destructive modulus and integer quotient operator for TeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides an easy way to take the remainder of a
longdesc division operation without destroying the values of the
longdesc counters containing the dividend and divisor. Also provides a
longdesc way to take the integer quotient of a division operation
longdesc without destroying the values of the counters containing the
longdesc dividend and divisor. A tiny but occasionally useful package,
longdesc when doing heavy TeX programming.
runfiles size=1
